te. The conference shall take place on 4/17/2025 at 1:30 PM. using Judge Cisneros's designated non-public Zoom Audio Conference. You will initially enter a \"waiting room\" and will be admitted into the meeting by court staff. The parties will receive an email from Judge Cisneros's Courtroom Deputy the day before the call with the call-in information.If counsel for either side is not available for the above date they must meet and confer with the other side and send an email to Judge Cisneros's CRD, Brittany Sims at ljccrd@cand.uscourts.gov providing a new date(s) to the Court within three business days. The parties are directed to review, in advance of the telephone pre-settlement conference Judge Cisneros's Settlement Standing Order on Judge Cisneros's webpage, by going to https://www.cand.uscourts.gov/wp-content/uploads/judges/cisneros-ljc/LJC-SettlementConferenceStandingOrder.pdf (This is a text-only entry generated by the court. There is no document associated with this entry.) (shy, COURT STAFF) (Filed on 4/3/2025) (Entered: 04/03/2025)", "tags": []}, {"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/docket-entries/428646568/", "id": 428646568, "docket": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/dockets/69015104/", "recap_documents": [{"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/recap-documents/442876744/", "id": 442876744, "tags": [], "absolute_url": "", "date_created": "2025-06-16T13:25:59.713122-07:00", "date_modified": "2025-06-16T13:25:59.719011-07:00", "sha1": "", "page_count": null, "file_size": null, "filepath_local": null, "filepath_ia": "", "ia_upload_failure_count": null, "thumbnail": null, "thumbnail_status": 0, "plain_text": "", "ocr_status": null, "date_upload": null, "document_number": "", "attachment_number": null, "pacer_doc_id": "", "is_available": false, "is_free_on_pacer": null, "is_sealed": null, "document_type": 1, "description": "", "acms_document_guid": ""}], "date_created": "2025-06-16T13:25:59.706143-07:00", 